// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
//
// Copy to Developer.local.xcconfig, which Git ignores, and name the developer's
// profile on X. Store a handle, never a whole address: `//` starts a comment in
// an xcconfig, and the code builds the address. A Release build made with this
// file has Follow developer on X, an Info row that opens the developer's
// profile on X; every other build carries none of it and no handle.
//
// The row also needs the logo in the ignored Local directory beside this one,
// where a build made with the handle and without the file fails:
//
//   Local/x-logo.svg   X's logo, a single-colour vector (one path, any fill)
//                      drawn as a template image

DEVELOPER_X_HANDLE = example_handle
